### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### NOTIFICATION SERVICE — Inbox & Read Status
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@host = http://localhost:18000
@access_token = {{access_token}}

### ── 1. Get unread count ────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{host}}/api/customer/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ── 2. List notifications ──────────────────────────────────────
GET {{host}}/api/customer/notifications?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

> {%
  if (response.body.content && response.body.content.length > 0) {
    client.global.set("notification_id", response.body.content[0].id);
  }
%}

### ── 3. Mark notification as read ───────────────────────────────
PATCH {{host}}/api/customer/notifications/{{notification_id}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ── 4. Mark all as read ────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{host}}/api/customer/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
